### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# Ganti token ini dengan token yang didapatkan dari response Login
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Register User Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kevin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Kevin Pratama"
}

### 2. Login User (Dapatkan Token JWT)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kevin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Buat Produk Baru (Protected Route - Memerlukan Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "name": "Monitor Gaming 4K 144Hz",
  "price": 6500000,
  "stock": 10
}

### 4. Buat Produk Kedua (Protected Route)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "name": "Keychron Q1 Pro Wireless",
  "price": 2800000,
  "stock": 15
}

### 5. Ambil Semua Produk (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Ambil Produk Berdasarkan ID (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Hapus Produk (Protected Route)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
